  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify explicit OMML and Unicode/Markdown loss boundaries over source-bound exact Math IR. Refuse Word documents, extra font/positioning markup, malformed or noncanonical XML, entity processing, changed math, placement ambiguity and unsupported glyphs. Recover one compiled RED, pass 38 independent GREEN tests and eight isolated NuGet-only probes, and inspect three local archives. Complete C04-T2, C04 and M5-W01; keep M5 and M5-W02 open.",
    "value": "Close the qualified exact mathematical interchange work package with independently verified security and semantic-loss boundaries. Preserve original Math IR and typed refusals without Office installation, source-free typography inference or document conversion.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS073 success, refine and prepare M5-W02-C01-T1: an independent .NET console numerical/symbolic vertical using qualified Math components, without prematurely promoting M5 or stable 1.0.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Compile and observe a genuinely missing public MathDisplayBoundaryAudit API RED against qualified codecs preview.7 before installing preview.8.",
      "Reuse existing secure exact OMML and Unicode Markdown renderers; do not create a second general XML/Office, TeX, Markdown or typography parser.",
      "Bind bounded source UTF-8 SHA-256 separately from canonical typed IR JSON, semantic structural hash and original expression identity.",
      "Explicitly refuse Word/Office containers, added font, fraction formatting or positioning markup, XML declaration deviations, entity/DTD and resource abuse.",
      "Classify Markdown inline/block placement mismatch, missing delimiters, ASCII slash, Unicode glyph alteration, LaTeX input, code fences and foreign wrappers as unqualified.",
      "Recover one compiled RED and pass 38 independent GREEN MSTests, locked .NET 10 Release solution build and focused codecs, Math IR and quantities regressions.",
      "Inspect three local net10 package archives with real byte lengths, nuspec dependencies and SHA-256; run eight isolated pinned NuGet-only probes.",
      "Complete C04-T2 RED/GREEN/verification, T2, C04 and M5-W01 with scientific aggregate evidence. Keep M5 active and M5-W02 unstarted."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M5-W01-C04-T2-R",
